recentEvaluations.tweetText:
@_chenglou I was part of that team. Basically ChatGPT one year before it came out. Called LMChat and then another codename.

Google was too nervous to release it and DeepMind was blocked from shipping products that could disrupt Google.

I think about this a lot.

